[{"id":451,"name":"AlphaRAR.aRTS_LLN","kind":"Theorem","keyword":"theorem","module":"AlphaRAR.YDK2026.ARTSRates","package":"AlphaRAR","isProp":true,"hashes":{"meaning":"c9edae3a372ee4ae","local":"b7457111224543bf","content":"04276fc8e1a6dc5d"},"doc":"**Strong consistency and rates for an aRTS design** (Theorem 4.1 of the paper). Under\nConditions **A** (`hνk`) and **B** (`hT`, `hTpos`, `hT_diff`, and the simplex conditions `hTnn`,\n`hTsum`) an `α`-throttled aRTS design satisfies, almost surely for every arm `k`:\nthe allocation proportion converges to the target `N_{n,k}/n → v_k = T(θ)_k`; the estimator is\nconsistent `θ̂_{n,k} → θ_k` and achieves the loglog rate `θ̂_{n,k} - θ_k = O(√(log log n / n))`; and\nthe plug-in target achieves the same rate `ρ̂_{n,k} - v_k = O(√(log log n / n))` — the last two are\nthe paper's `Θ̂_n - Θ = O(√(log log n / n))` and `n(ρ̂_n - v) = O(√(n log log n))`. Bundles\n`aRTS_proportion_tendsto`, `aRTS_theta_consistent`, `aRTS_theta_rate`, `aRTS_rho_rate`. ","statement":{"binders":[{"explicit":false,"implicit":true,"name":"Ω","role":"type","type":"Type u_1","typeRefs":[]},{"explicit":false,"implicit":true,"name":"𝓐","role":"type","type":"Type u_2","typeRefs":[]},{"explicit":false,"head":"MeasurableSpace","implicit":true,"name":"mΩ","role":"instance","type":"MeasurableSpace Ω","typeRefs":[[0,15,"MeasurableSpace"]]},{"explicit":false,"head":"MeasurableSpace","implicit":true,"name":"m𝓐","role":"instance","type":"MeasurableSpace 𝓐","typeRefs":[[0,15,"MeasurableSpace"]]},{"explicit":false,"head":"MeasurableSingletonClass","implicit":false,"name":"","role":"instance","type":"MeasurableSingletonClass 𝓐","typeRefs":[[0,24,"MeasurableSingletonClass"]]},{"explicit":false,"head":"DecidableEq","implicit":false,"name":"","role":"instance","type":"DecidableEq 𝓐","typeRefs":[[0,11,"DecidableEq"]]},{"explicit":false,"head":"Fintype","implicit":false,"name":"","role":"instance","type":"Fintype 𝓐","typeRefs":[[0,7,"Fintype"]]},{"explicit":false,"head":"StandardBorelSpace","implicit":false,"name":"","role":"instance","type":"StandardBorelSpace 𝓐","typeRefs":[[0,18,"StandardBorelSpace"]]},{"explicit":false,"head":"Nonempty","implicit":false,"name":"","role":"instance","type":"Nonempty 𝓐","typeRefs":[[0,8,"Nonempty"]]},{"explicit":false,"head":"ProbabilityTheory.Kernel","implicit":true,"name":"ν","role":"variable","type":"ProbabilityTheory.Kernel 𝓐 ℝ","typeRefs":[[0,24,"ProbabilityTheory.Kernel"],[27,28,"Real"]]},{"explicit":false,"head":"ProbabilityTheory.IsMarkovKernel","implicit":false,"name":"","role":"instance","type":"ProbabilityTheory.IsMarkovKernel ν","typeRefs":[[0,32,"ProbabilityTheory.IsMarkovKernel"]]},{"explicit":false,"head":"MeasureTheory.Measure","implicit":true,"name":"P","role":"variable","type":"MeasureTheory.Measure Ω","typeRefs":[[0,21,"MeasureTheory.Measure"]]},{"explicit":false,"head":"MeasureTheory.IsProbabilityMeasure","implicit":false,"name":"","role":"instance","type":"MeasureTheory.IsProbabilityMeasure P","typeRefs":[[0,34,"MeasureTheory.IsProbabilityMeasure"]]},{"explicit":false,"implicit":true,"name":"O","role":"variable","type":"ℕ → Ω → Unit","typeRefs":[[0,1,"Nat"],[8,12,"Unit"]]},{"explicit":false,"implicit":true,"name":"A","role":"variable","type":"ℕ → Ω → 𝓐","typeRefs":[[0,1,"Nat"]]},{"explicit":false,"implicit":true,"name":"Y","role":"variable","type":"ℕ → Ω → ℝ","typeRefs":[[0,1,"Nat"],[8,9,"Real"]]},{"explicit":false,"head":"Learning.Algorithm","implicit":true,"name":"alg","role":"variable","type":"Learning.Algorithm Unit 𝓐 ℝ","typeRefs":[[0,18,"Learning.Algorithm"],[19,23,"Unit"],[26,27,"Real"]]},{"explicit":true,"head":"Learning.IsAlgEnvSeq","implicit":false,"name":"h","role":"hypothesis","type":"Learning.IsAlgEnvSeq O A Y alg (Learning.stationaryEnv ν) P","typeRefs":[[0,20,"Learning.IsAlgEnvSeq"],[32,54,"Learning.stationaryEnv"]]},{"explicit":true,"implicit":false,"name":"hνk","role":"hypothesis","type":"∀ (a : 𝓐), MeasureTheory.MemLp id 2 (ν a)","typeRefs":[[11,30,"MeasureTheory.MemLp"],[31,33,"id"]]},{"explicit":false,"implicit":true,"name":"θ₀","role":"variable","type":"𝓐 → ℝ","typeRefs":[[4,5,"Real"]]},{"explicit":false,"implicit":true,"name":"T","role":"variable","type":"(𝓐 → ℝ) → 𝓐 → ℝ","typeRefs":[[5,6,"Real"],[14,15,"Real"]]},{"explicit":true,"head":"Continuous","implicit":false,"name":"hT","role":"hypothesis","type":"Continuous T","typeRefs":[[0,10,"Continuous"]]},{"explicit":true,"implicit":false,"name":"hTnn","role":"hypothesis","type":"∀ (z : 𝓐 → ℝ) (k : 𝓐), 0 ≤ T z k","typeRefs":[[11,12,"Real"],[25,26,"LE.le"]]},{"explicit":true,"implicit":false,"name":"hTsum","role":"hypothesis","type":"∀ (z : 𝓐 → ℝ), ∑ k, T z k = 1","typeRefs":[[11,12,"Real"],[26,27,"Eq"]]},{"explicit":false,"head":"Real","implicit":true,"name":"α","role":"variable","type":"ℝ","typeRefs":[[0,1,"Real"]]},{"explicit":true,"head":"Membership.mem","implicit":false,"name":"hα","role":"hypothesis","type":"α ∈ Set.Icc 0 1","typeRefs":[[2,3,"Membership.mem"],[4,11,"Set.Icc"]]},{"explicit":true,"head":"AlphaRAR.IsARTS","implicit":false,"name":"hARTS","role":"hypothesis","type":"IsARTS alg θ₀ T α","typeRefs":[[0,6,"AlphaRAR.IsARTS"]]},{"explicit":true,"implicit":false,"name":"hTpos","role":"hypothesis","type":"∀ (z : 𝓐 → ℝ), (∀ (k : 𝓐), z k ∈ attainableSet A Y (θ₀ k) k) → ∀ (k : 𝓐), 0 < T z k","typeRefs":[[11,12,"Real"],[31,32,"Membership.mem"],[33,46,"AlphaRAR.attainableSet"],[76,77,"LT.lt"]]},{"explicit":true,"head":"DifferentiableAt","implicit":false,"name":"hT_diff","role":"hypothesis","type":"DifferentiableAt ℝ T ν.means","typeRefs":[[0,16,"DifferentiableAt"],[17,18,"Real"],[23,28,"ProbabilityTheory.Kernel.means"]]},{"explicit":true,"implicit":false,"name":"k","role":"variable","type":"𝓐","typeRefs":[]}],"conclusion":"∀ᵐ (ω : Ω) ∂P,\n  Filter.Tendsto (fun n => ↑(Learning.pullCount A k n ω) / ↑n) Filter.atTop (nhds (T ν.means k)) ∧\n    Filter.Tendsto\n        (fun n => estimator (fun j => Learning.actionIndicator A k j ω) (fun x => Y x ω) (θ₀ k) n)\n        Filter.atTop (nhds (ν.means k)) ∧\n      ((fun n =>\n            estimator (fun j => Learning.actionIndicator A k j ω) (fun x => Y x ω) (θ₀ k) n -\n              ν.means k) =O[Filter.atTop]\n          fun n => √(↑n * Real.log (Real.log ↑n)) / ↑n) ∧\n        (fun n =>\n            T\n                (fun k' =>\n                  estimator (fun j => Learning.actionIndicator A k' j ω) (fun x => Y x ω) (θ₀ k') n)\n                k -\n              T ν.means k) =O[Filter.atTop]\n          fun n => √(↑n * Real.log (Real.log ↑n)) / ↑n","conclusionHead":"Filter.Eventually","conclusionRefs":[[0,2,"Filter.Eventually"],[11,12,"Filter.Eventually"],[17,31,"Filter.Tendsto"],[44,62,"Learning.pullCount"],[72,73,"HDiv.hDiv"],[78,90,"Filter.atTop"],[92,96,"nhds"],[102,107,"ProbabilityTheory.Kernel.means"],[112,113,"And"],[118,132,"Filter.Tendsto"],[151,160,"AlphaRAR.estimator"],[171,195,"Learning.actionIndicator"],[240,252,"Filter.atTop"],[254,258,"nhds"],[262,267,"ProbabilityTheory.Kernel.means"],[272,273,"And"],[303,312,"AlphaRAR.estimator"],[323,347,"Learning.actionIndicator"],[383,384,"HSub.hSub"],[401,406,"ProbabilityTheory.Kernel.means"],[410,413,"Asymptotics.IsBigO"],[413,425,"Filter.atTop"],[446,447,"Real.sqrt"],[451,452,"HMul.hMul"],[453,461,"Real.log"],[463,471,"Real.log"],[477,478,"HDiv.hDiv"],[483,484,"And"],[562,571,"AlphaRAR.estimator"],[582,606,"Learning.actionIndicator"],[663,664,"HSub.hSub"],[683,688,"ProbabilityTheory.Kernel.means"],[692,695,"Asymptotics.IsBigO"],[695,707,"Filter.atTop"],[728,729,"Real.sqrt"],[733,734,"HMul.hMul"],[735,743,"Real.log"],[745,753,"Real.log"],[759,760,"HDiv.hDiv"]],"decl":"AlphaRAR.aRTS_LLN"},"code":"/-- **Strong consistency and rates for an aRTS design** (Theorem 4.1 of the paper). Under\nConditions **A** (`hνk`) and **B** (`hT`, `hTpos`, `hT_diff`, and the simplex conditions `hTnn`,\n`hTsum`) an `α`-throttled aRTS design satisfies, almost surely for every arm `k`:\nthe allocation proportion converges to the target `N_{n,k}/n → v_k = T(θ)_k`; the estimator is\nconsistent `θ̂_{n,k} → θ_k` and achieves the loglog rate `θ̂_{n,k} - θ_k = O(√(log log n / n))`; and\nthe plug-in target achieves the same rate `ρ̂_{n,k} - v_k = O(√(log log n / n))` — the last two are\nthe paper's `Θ̂_n - Θ = O(√(log log n / n))` and `n(ρ̂_n - v) = O(√(n log log n))`. Bundles\n`aRTS_proportion_tendsto`, `aRTS_theta_consistent`, `aRTS_theta_rate`, `aRTS_rho_rate`. -/\ntheorem aRTS_LLN (h : IsAlgEnvSeq O A Y alg (stationaryEnv ν) P)\n    (hνk : ∀ a, MemLp id 2 (ν a)) {θ₀ : 𝓐 → ℝ} {T : (𝓐 → ℝ) → 𝓐 → ℝ} (hT : Continuous T)\n    (hTnn : ∀ z k, 0 ≤ T z k) (hTsum : ∀ z, ∑ k, T z k = 1)\n    {α : ℝ} (hα : α ∈ Set.Icc (0 : ℝ) 1) (hARTS : IsARTS alg θ₀ T α)\n    (hTpos : ∀ z : 𝓐 → ℝ, (∀ k, z k ∈ attainableSet A Y (θ₀ k) k) → ∀ k, 0 < T z k)\n    (hT_diff : DifferentiableAt ℝ T ν.means) (k : 𝓐) :\n    ∀ᵐ ω ∂P,\n      Tendsto (fun n ↦ (pullCount A k n ω : ℝ) / (n : ℝ)) atTop (𝓝 (T ν.means k)) ∧\n      Tendsto (fun n ↦ estimator (fun j ↦ actionIndicator A k j ω)\n        (Y · ω) (θ₀ k) n) atTop (𝓝 (ν.means k)) ∧\n      (fun n ↦ estimator (fun j ↦ actionIndicator A k j ω) (Y · ω) (θ₀ k) n - ν.means k)\n          =O[atTop] (fun n ↦ √((n : ℝ) * log (log (n : ℝ))) / (n : ℝ)) ∧\n      (fun n ↦ T (fun k' ↦ estimator (fun j ↦ actionIndicator A k' j ω)\n        (Y · ω) (θ₀ k') n) k - T ν.means k)\n          =O[atTop] (fun n ↦ √((n : ℝ) * log (log (n : ℝ))) / (n : ℝ))","proof":":= by\n  filter_upwards [aRTS_proportion_tendsto h hνk hT hTnn hTsum hα hARTS hTpos k,\n    aRTS_theta_consistent h hνk hT hTnn hTsum hα hARTS hTpos,\n    aRTS_theta_rate h hνk hT hTnn hTsum hα hARTS hTpos k,\n    aRTS_rho_rate h hνk hT hTnn hTsum hα hARTS hTpos hT_diff k]\n    with ω hprop hθ hθrate hrate\n  exact ⟨hprop, tendsto_pi_nhds.mp hθ k, hθrate, hrate⟩","source":{"path":"AlphaRAR/YDK2026/ARTSRates.lean","start":180,"end":208,"url":"https://github.com/RemyDegenne/alpha-rar/blob/e7164a80baea3f4f65e108de31d2d561dd35e350/AlphaRAR/YDK2026/ARTSRates.lean#L180-L208"},"deps